# INVWINEA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: every row of the
# item list chosen, the seed's three items and the 257 of
# INVWIN_WINSEEDEA (TEST/WIN/mkitems.sh), 260 rows of many pages, with
# the preview beside the list (no settings file, INVWIN_WINARGSEA).
# CTRL-/ (the driver's SLASH) chooses all 260, the count panel saying so
# and every row shown selected, the preview staying on the focus row;
# PGDN, END and HOME keep them, each page's rows selected; ENTER shows
# the focus row's item, and ESC from it keeps them.  Each of these
# leaves the focus row alone chosen: UP, DOWN, SHIFT-DOWN, a click, a
# CTRL click, SHIFT-F8 (which starts the add mode), CTRL-\ (BSLASH), a
# heading's click, Next order, F5, the focus row's item edited and
# saved, and the Find box's search, whose one result CTRL-/ chooses as
# all, DEL then asking as for one item; CTRL-\ and a click end that
# choice of one row too, the count panel counting the list again.
# CTRL-/ in the add mode ends it, so that UP then leaves one row and no
# mode; CTRL-\ also ends a choice of three rows and the add mode.
# Record > Select all (the fifth entry, which has no letter) chooses
# them as the key does, and the pop-up on a row keeps them.  An Esc
# typed ahead of CTRL-/ in the preview, whose keys the frame takes at
# once, stops the collecting and leaves what was chosen: all, and then
# three rows.  CTRL-\ in the preview leaves the focus row alone chosen
# as in the list, and a \ without CTRL keeps all.  On the location tree,
# which takes one row, CTRL-/ does nothing and the Record menu has no
# Select all.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEA.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S OPEN
K CTRL-SLASH
S ALL
K PGDN
S ALLPG2
K END
S ALLEND
K HOME PGDN ENTER
S ALLVIEW
K ESC
S ALLBACK
K UP
S UPONE
K CTRL-SLASH DOWN
S DOWNONE
K CTRL-SLASH SHIFT-DOWN
S SHIFTONE
K CTRL-SLASH
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 3
M 208.1 UP ROW 3
S CLICKONE
K CTRL-SLASH
M 208.1 CTRL-DOWN ROW 5
M 208.1 CTRL-UP ROW 5
S CTRLONE
K CTRL-SLASH SHIFT-F8
S ADDONE
K SPACE DOWN DOWN SPACE CTRL-SLASH
S ADDALL
K UP
S ADDUP
K CTRL-SLASH CTRL-BSLASH
S NONE
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S THREE
K CTRL-BSLASH
S THREENO
K SHIFT-F8 DOWN SPACE CTRL-BSLASH
S ADDNO
K CTRL-SLASH
M 208 DOWN HEAD 2
M 208 UP HEAD 2
S HEADONE
K CTRL-SLASH ALT-C R
S ORDERONE
K ALT-I I CTRL-SLASH F5
S F5ONE
K CTRL-SLASH CTRL-E ALT-M
T Zenith
K ENTER
S EDITONE
K CTRL-SLASH CTRL-F
T Hercules
K ENTER
S FINDONE
K CTRL-SLASH
S ONEALL
K DEL
S ONEDEL
K N CTRL-BSLASH
S ONENONE
K CTRL-SLASH
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
S ONECLICK
K ALT-I I
K ALT-C
S MENU
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S MENUALL
M 208.1 RDOWN ROW 2
M 208.1 RUP ROW 2
S RPOP
K ESC
S RPOPBK
K F6 CTRL-SLASH
P ESC
S STOPPED
K CTRL-BSLASH
S PVNONE
K F6 SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN F6 CTRL-SLASH
P ESC
S STOP3
K F6 CTRL-SLASH BSLASH
S BSLASH
K ALT-L B CTRL-SLASH
S TREE
K ALT-C
S TREEMENU
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
